    "30 分钟未完成新一组，本轮自动结束。目标组数可在右上角设置中调整。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your session ends after 30 minutes without a new set. Use the settings above to change your set goal."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 分钟未完成新一组，本轮自动结束。目标组数可在右上角设置中调整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daywell 使用屏幕使用时间，为睡眠、聚焦和健身限制应用。点击“继续”查看系统授权请求，你可以选择是否允许。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daywell uses Screen Time to limit apps during Sleep, Focus, and workouts. Tap Continue to see the system prompt and choose whether to allow access."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daywell 使用屏幕使用时间，为睡眠、聚焦和健身限制应用。点击“继续”查看系统授权请求，你可以选择是否允许。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daywell 提供睡眠时段锁定、聚焦和健身计数，帮助管理日常节奏。配置仅保存在当前设备，不测量实际睡眠。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daywell helps you schedule app limits, focus on one app, and count workout sets. Settings stay on this device. Daywell doesn't measure your sleep."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daywell 提供睡眠时段锁定、聚焦和健身计数，帮助管理日常节奏。配置仅保存在当前设备，不测量实际睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daywell 预览": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
