    "「%@ %@」与已保存的「%@ %@」重叠。请调整时间或重复星期。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@ %@” overlaps the saved block “%@ %@”. Change the times or repeat days."
