    "免费预览版可编辑时段和豁免设置，不支持应用圈选、实际锁定或临时解锁。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The free preview lets you edit schedules and passes. App selection, restrictions, and temporary passes require the full app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
