    "可以体验界面、编辑时段和豁免设置；此版本不会实际锁定应用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can preview the interface and edit blocks and passes. Actual restrictions are unavailable in this version."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以体验界面、编辑时段和豁免设置；此版本不会实际锁定应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以添加多个时段，按星期重复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
