          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以添加多个时段，按星期重复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可体验睡眠、聚焦和健身的界面与设置，不会实际锁定应用。配置仅保存在当前预览应用，不会同步到完整版本。不测量实际睡眠。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview Sleep, Focus, and Workout settings. The preview can't restrict apps, sync its settings to the full app, or measure your sleep."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可体验睡眠、聚焦和健身的界面与设置，不会实际锁定应用。配置仅保存在当前预览应用，不会同步到完整版本。不测量实际睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可预览倒计时。应用锁定需要在已授权的真机上运行完整版。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can preview the timer. To limit apps, use the full app on an authorized iPhone or iPad."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可预览倒计时。应用锁定需要在已授权的真机上运行完整版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同时安排的锁定任务过多，无法保证按时恢复。请先关闭部分时段后重试，原有设置已保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too many restrictions are scheduled to guarantee that they end on time. Disable some blocks and try again. Your existing settings are saved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时安排的锁定任务过多，无法保证按时恢复。请先关闭部分时段后重试，原有设置已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同时执行的锁定范围过多，请先结束部分时段后重试。": {
