    "圈选应用合计可用 %lld 分钟，用满后休息 %lld 分钟。中途退出会保留已用时长。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selected apps share %lld min of use, followed by a %lld min break. Usage already counted is kept when you leave the app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圈选应用合计可用 %lld 分钟，用满后休息 %lld 分钟。中途退出会保留已用时长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在底栏「设置」开启屏幕使用时间授权。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To limit apps, grant Screen Time access in the Settings tab."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
