      }
    },
    "此设置下不提供临时豁免，锁定页不会显示豁免按钮。修改会在后续时段生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No passes will be offered on the restriction screen. The change applies to future blocks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设置下不提供临时豁免，锁定页不会显示豁免按钮。修改会在后续时段生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个时段单独计算豁免次数；正在执行的时段保留原定时间与豁免规则。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passes are tracked per block. A block in progress keeps its original schedule and pass rules."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个时段单独计算豁免次数；正在执行的时段保留原定时间与豁免规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个时段可设置 0–5 次豁免，每次时长需为 1–1440 分钟。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each block can offer 0 to 5 passes. Each pass must last between 1 and 1,440 minutes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个时段可设置 0–5 次豁免，每次时长需为 1–1440 分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
