            "value": "每组休息时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每组完成后重新计时，休息结束会锁定应用。睡眠时段内只计时。完成本轮或 30 分钟未完成新一组后，自动结束本轮并解除运动锁定。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The timer restarts after each set. Apps are restricted when rest ends. During sleep blocks, only the timer runs. Completing the workout or going 30 minutes without a new set ends the session and lifts workout restrictions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每组完成后重新计时，休息结束会锁定应用。睡眠时段内只计时。完成本轮或 30 分钟未完成新一组后，自动结束本轮并解除运动锁定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每轮目标组数": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set Goal"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每轮目标组数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每轮睡眠与随后的清晨模式共用次数，最多 5 次。默认 2 次，时长依次为 10、5、3、2、1 分钟，可分别调整。修改会在后续时段生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A sleep block and its Morning Mode share up to five passes. The default is two. Preset lengths are 10, 5, 3, 2, and 1 min. You can adjust each one. Changes apply to future blocks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每轮睡眠与随后的清晨模式共用次数，最多 5 次。默认 2 次，时长依次为 10、5、3、2、1 分钟，可分别调整。修改会在后续时段生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
